hadiths[67]{hadithnumber,text}:
"3358","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apne mareezon ka sadqe se ilaaj karo."
"3359","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Chamre ki dabaghat us ki taharat hai."
"3360","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Murdaar ki khaalon ki dabaghat un ki taharat hai."
"3361","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har khaal ki dabaghat us ki taharat hai."
"3362","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Dihya Kalbi Jibreel se mushabeh hain, Urwa bin Masood Saqafi Isa bin Maryam se mushabeh hain, aur Abd-ul-Uzza Dajjal se mushabeh hai."
"3363","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main kal raat jannat mein dakhil hua aur us mein dekha; kiya dekhta hun ke Jaafar farishton ke saath ur rahe hain aur Hamza takht par tek lagaye hue hain."
"3364","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main jannat mein dakhil hua; kiya dekhta hun ke sone ka aik mahal hai; maine kaha: Ye mahal kis ka hai? Unhon ne kaha: Quraish ke aik naujawan ka hai; maine samjha ke wo main hun; maine kaha: Aur wo kaun hai? Unhon ne kaha: Umar bin Khattab hain; agar mujhe tumhari ghairat ka ilm na hota to main us mein dakhil hota."
"3365","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main jannat mein dakhil hua; kiya dekhta hun ke aik neher hai jis ke donon kinare moti ke kheme hain; maine apna haath us mein jo paani behta tha us par maara to tez mushk nikli; maine kaha: Ae Jibreel, ye kiya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Ye Kausar hai jo Allah ne tumhein ataa ki hai."
"3366","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main jannat mein dakhil hua to meri mulakat aik naujawan laundi se hui; maine kaha: Tum kis ki ho? Us ne kaha: Zaid bin Harisa ki."
"3367","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main jannat mein dakhil hua aur Zaid bin Amr bin Nufail ke liye do darje dekhe."
"3368","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main jannat mein dakhil hua aur apne aage khash-khashahat suni; maine kaha: Ye khash-khashahat kiya hai? To kaha gaya: Ghumaisa bint Milhan hain."
"3369","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main jannat mein dakhil hua aur apne aage khash-khashahat suni; maine kaha: Ye khash-khashahat kiya hai? To kaha gaya: Ye Bilal hain jo tumhare aage chal rahe hain."
"3370","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main jannat mein dakhil hua aur khash-khashahat suni; maine kaha: Ye kiya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Ye Bilal hain; phir main jannat mein dakhil hua aur khash-khashahat suni; maine kaha: Ye kiya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Ye Ghumaisa bint Milhan hain."
"3371","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main jannat mein dakhil hua aur us mein qiraat suni; maine kaha: Ye kaun hai? Unhon ne kaha: Harisa bin Noman hain; neki aisi hi hoti hai, neki aisi hi hoti hai."
"3372","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main meraj ki raat jannat mein dakhil hua aur us ke aik pehlu mein aahat suni; maine kaha: Ae Jibreel, ye kiya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Ye Bilal muazzin hain."
"3373","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Umra hajj mein qayamat ke din tak dakhil ho chuka hai."
"3374","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aik aurat aag mein dakhil hui billi ki wajah se jise us ne bandha tha: na use khilaya na use chhora ke zameen ke keere-makore khaye, yahan tak ke wo mar gayi."
"3375","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sood ka aik dirham jise aadmi jaante hue khaye, Allah ke nazdeek chhattees zina se zyada sakht hai."
"3376","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Doodh dene wali ko chhor do."
"3377","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo tumhein shak mein daale use chhor do us ki taraf jo tumhein shak mein na daale."
"3378","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo tumhein shak mein daale use chhor do us ki taraf jo tumhein shak mein na daale; kyunke sach sukoon hai aur jhoot shak hai."
"3379","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bhai ki apne bhai ke liye peeth peeche dua radd nahi hoti."
"3380","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Musalman aadmi ki apne bhai ke liye peeth peeche dua qubool hoti hai; us ke sar ke paas muakkal farishta hai: jab wo apne bhai ke liye khair ki dua karta hai to farishta kehta hai: Aameen, aur tumhein bhi isi jaise mile."
"3381","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aadmi ki apne bhai ke liye peeth peeche dua qubool hoti hai; aur us ke sar ke paas farishta hai jo kehta hai: Aameen, aur tumhein bhi isi jaise mile."
"3382","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mazloom ki dua qubool hoti hai chahe wo badkaar ho; pas us ka fisq us par hai."
"3383","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Zunnoon ki dua jab unhon ne us se dua ki jabke wo machhli ke pet mein the: Tere siwa koi mabood nahi, tu paak hai, beshak main zalimon mein se tha; jo musalman aadmi us se kisi cheez mein kabhi dua kare to Allah use zaroor qubool karta hai."
"3384","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Habsha walon ko chhoro jab tak wo tumhein chhorein; aur Turk walon ko chhoro jab tak wo tumhein chhorein."
"3385","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Logon ko chhoro ke baaz baaz se faida uthayein; pas jab tum mein se koi apne bhai se mashwara mange to use mashwara de."
"3386","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere sahaba ko mere liye chhor do; qasam hai us zaat ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai, agar tum Uhud jitna sona kharch karo to un ke aamaal ko nahi pahunchoge."
"3387","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Use chhor do; kyunke haq wale ko kehne ka haq hai."
"3388","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Museebat-zade ki duayein: Ae Allah, main teri rehmat ki ummeed rakhta hun; pas mujhe palak jhapakne bhar bhi mere nafs ke supurd na kar; aur mere saare muamle durust farma; tere siwa koi mabood nahi."
"3389","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Us mitti mein dafan hua jis se paida hua tha."
"3390","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khair ki rehnumayi karne wala us ke karne wale jaise hai."
"3391","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Surkh-safaid ka khoon Allah ko kaalon se zyada mehboob hai."
"3392","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Surkh-safaid ka khoon Allah ke nazdeek kaalon ke khoon se zyada paakeeza hai."
"3393","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tumhare saamne hai, badla lo."
"3394","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Haathon aur pairon ki ungliyon ki diyat barabar hai: har ungli ke liye das oont."
"3395","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Muahid ki diyat aazaad ki diyat se aadhi hai."
"3396","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mukatib ki diyat jis qadar wo aazaad hua aazaad ki diyat hai aur jis qadar wo ghulam raha ghulam ki diyat hai."
"3397","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kafir ki aqal ki diyat momin ki aqal ki diyat se aadhi hai."
"3398","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aik deenar jo tum ne Allah ke raaste mein kharch kiya; aik deenar jo tum ne gardan azaad karne mein kharch kiya; aik deenar jo tum ne miskeen par sadqa kiya; aur aik deenar jo tum ne apne ghar walon par kharch kiya; sab se bara ajr wala wo hai jo tum ne apne ghar walon par kharch kiya."
"3399","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khair par dalalat karne wala us ke karne wale jaise hai."
"3400","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Dajjal ki bayein aankh kani hai, us ke baal ghane hain; us ke saath jannat aur aag hogi; pas us ki aag jannat hai aur us ki jannat aag hai."
"3401","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Dajjal ki aankh sabz hai."
"3402","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Dajjal ki aankh miti hui hai; us ki donon aankhon ke darmiyan kafir likha hoga jise har musalman parhega."
"3403","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Dajjal ki aulaad nahi hogi aur wo Madina aur Makka mein dakhil nahi hoga."
"3404","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Dajjal mashriq ki zameen se niklega jise Khurasan kaha jata hai; us ke peeche aisi qaumein hongi goya un ke chehre kooti hui dhalen hain."
"3405","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Azan aur iqamat ke darmiyan dua qubool hoti hai; pas dua karo."
"3406","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Nida aur iqamat ke darmiyan dua qubool hoti hai."
"3407","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Dua hi ibadat hai."
"3408","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Azan aur iqamat ke darmiyan dua radd nahi hoti."
"3409","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Dua jo nazil hua aur jo nazil nahi hua donon mein nafa deti hai; pas tum par dua lazim hai ae Allah ke bando."
"3410","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Duniya meethi sabz hai; pas jo use us ke haq ke saath le us ke liye us mein barkat rakhi jayegi; aur kitne apne nafs ki khwahish mein doobe hue hain jin ke liye qayamat ke din aag ke siwa kuch nahi."
"3411","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Duniya sabz meethi hai."
"3412","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Duniya momin ka qaid-khana aur kafir ki jannat hai."
"3413","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Poori duniya saamaan hai aur duniya ka behtareen saamaan naik aurat hai."
"3414","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Duniya mal'oon hai aur jo us mein hai mal'oon hai, siwa Allah ke zikr aur jo us se talluq rakhta ho, aur aalim ya seekhne wale ke."
"3415","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Dawa taqdeer mein se hai aur Allah taala ke izn se nafa de sakti hai."
"3416","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Dawa taqdeer mein se hai aur wo jise chahe jis se chahe nafa deti hai."
"3417","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Deen khairkhwahi hai."
"3418","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qarz do tarah ke hain; pas jo mar jaye jabke wo us ki adayegi ki niyyat rakhta ho to main us ka sarparast hun; aur jo mar jaye aur us ki adayegi ki niyyat na rakhta ho to wahi hai jis se us ki nekiyon mein se liya jayega; us din na deenar hoga na dirham."
"3419","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qarz wasiyyat se pehle hai; aur waris ke liye wasiyyat nahi."
"3420","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Deen aasaan hai; aur deen par jo ghalib aana chahe wo use maghloob kar dega."
"3421","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Deenar deenar se, dirham dirham se, gehun ka sa' gehun ke sa' se, jau ka sa' jau ke sa' se, namak ka sa' namak ke sa' se; in mein se kisi mein zyadti nahi."
"3422","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Deenar deenar se, in donon mein koi zyadti nahi; aur dirham dirham se, in donon mein koi zyadti nahi."
"3423","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Deenar deenar se, in donon mein koi zyadti nahi; aur dirham dirham se, in donon mein koi zyadti nahi; pas jis ki chaandi mein haajat ho wo unhein sone se tabdeel kare; aur jis ki sone mein haajat ho wo use chaandi se tabdeel kare; aur tabadla haath se haath hai."
"3424","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Deenar khazana hai, dirham khazana hai aur qeeraat khazana hai."
